<!--
  dsfdr (Dancing Stage Fever, GCA37 VER. JAA) -- PLAY launcher. Loads the GAME
  cassette (gca37ja.u1 + gca37ja.u6: ZS01 / NS2K001 PIC). Boots from the flash
  restored out of dsfdr.sav, so run dsfdr_install.mgl first.

  ZS01 SIZE PADDING: the MAME dump gca37ja.u1 is the raw 140-byte ZS01 nvram image
  (RtR + cmd key + data key + config + 112 data). emu.sv infers the cart type from
  the .u1 SIZE (>=560 -> ZS01 type 2; >=256 -> X76F041; else X76F100), so
  dsfdr.u1 is that image padded with zeros to 4116 B. zs01.v drops every loaded
  byte at addr >= 140, so the padding is inert. Generate and VERIFY it with
  tools/stage_zs01_u1.py (checks the RtR, the fixed PIC command key against
  zs01.v's default, the plaintext game code, and the DS2401 serial cross-checked
  byte-reversed against the .u6).

  Verified for this cassette: game code GCA37, region JA, command key
  ed68504bc644483e (identical to ddrusa's -- the fixed PIC key is shared across
  cartridges), per-cart data key c187d3242284edb2, DS2401 d202030405060701 found
  byte-reversed at data[40].

  BLOCKED until the ZS01 detection bug is fixed: PSX.EXE identifies the cassette
  from its response-to-reset before any command, and on ddrusa that probe is
  rejected -- ERROR 121 (3), which decodes to "no cassette type detected"
  (docs/2026-09-14-ddrusa-error121-decoded.md). dsfdr's INSTALL phase uses an
  X76F041 and is unaffected, so install with dsfdr_install.mgl meanwhile.

  Disc a37jaa02.chd is MODE1_RAW (TRACK:1 TYPE:MODE1_RAW SUBTYPE:RW_RAW
  FRAMES:57277), so dsfdr.chd is used directly -- no cue+raw2352 conversion of
  the kind dsem's MODE1/2048 disc needed.

  Six items max (mra_loader.h item[6]). OSD: 573 Cabinet = STANDARD; 573 MP3
  Descramble = DEFAULT; 573 Boot Device = Flash ROM.
-->
<mistergamedescription>
  <rbf>_Console/Konami_System_573</rbf>
  <setname>System573</setname>
  <file delay="1" type="f" index="0" path="573bios.bin"/>
  <file delay="1" type="f" index="4" path="dsfdr.u1"/>
  <file delay="1" type="f" index="5" path="dsfdr.u6"/>
  <file delay="2" type="s" index="1" path="dsfdr.chd"/>
  <file delay="3" type="s" index="4" path="dsfdr.sav"/>
  <reset delay="1"/>
</mistergamedescription>
